rooms_desc ({"You have entered the living room in Ecco's house, where he entertainshis guests.  As you enter, you feel at ease and have a sudden urge tosit and relax.  On one side of the room there is a black leather sofaand loveseat, two end tables and a LazyBoy recliner.  On the otherside of the room you see an entertainment center complete with an RCAProScan wide screen TV, VCR and rack stereo system.  On one side ofthe entertainment center you see a rather large aquarium with manyexotic tropical fish swimming happily inside it.  You notice Eccolounging around in the Lazyboy while channel surfing with the remote!","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interes